==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Clown Base (Enemy Base)|Clown Base]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

